gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=P6 ASYMMETRIC diagnostic -- 256x drive on the OFFENSIVE member only, over P1+P4.
// The operator caught P5 as a symmetric test: the sweep writes one shared
// magnitude to BOTH members of an engagement, so 256x cancelled and only a
// lopsided size mismatch leaked through (the #72 pancake). P6 gates the
// eight doublings on the player's side byte (+0x01, 0 = offense) so only
// the blocker scales. THE question: does the defender now go backwards?
// Still a global R5 violation and still on unproven cave #7 -- throwaway.

